 and prices for gold\par and government debt on Monday as the heightened tensions spurred investors to\par seek safe havens and sell any exposure to the region. \par     * Crude oil prices rose around $2 a barrel on Monday as tensions mounted\par amid Russian military \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on the Crimean peninsula. \par     * Seoul shares posted their worst daily fall in nearly a month on Monday,\par dragged down by escalating geopolitical tensions in Ukraine, while a contraction\par in Chinese factory activity prompted investors to lock in recent gains. \par \par          \par  Latest KR stock report       Latest money report          \par  Latest stocks             KR press digest          \par  Global Markets report  Oil Markets report            \par  New York stocks               Emerging markets report  \par     \par     DIARIES & DATA:\par     U.S. earnings diary       \par     European diary       \par     Asia Macro          \par    \par     TOP NEWS:\par     Front Page          Asian companies      \par     U.S. company News    European companies   \par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  news           Global Economy       \par     Tech, Media & Telecoms                              \par \par  (Compiled by Sohee Kim)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Released: 2014-3-6T22:39:48.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020140303ea3300yvm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
