\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-\uc2 Russian Finance Ministry\uc2  to buy $6 billion in foreign  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 471 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Februar 2014\par 16:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2014 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds detail, quotes)\par \par \uc2 By Lidia Kelly\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Feb 18 (Reuters) - \uc2 Russia's Finance Ministry\uc2  said on Tuesday it would buy 212.2 billion roubles ($6 billion) in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  via the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  through open market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  between Feb. 20 and May 31.\par \par \uc2 It said the move would not impact the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The ministry said the purchases would be fixed at 3.5 billion roubles a day. The funds are earmarked for the budget's $87 billion Reserve Fund, one of two sovereign funds financed from oil taxes.\par \par \uc2 Plans by the ministry to purchase foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the Reserve Fund have been a major factor weighing on the rouble in recent weeks. Earlier this month the rouble temporarily rallied when the finance ministry said that it would delay its purchases in order to ease the downward pressure on the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 At that time it said it planned to complete the purchases by April 1, a tighter deadline than envisaged in the final version of the plan announced on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's purchases on the open market will be factored into the bank's daily \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "I think that this won't have a serious impact on the rouble," Deputy Finance Minister Alexei Moiseev told journalists, announcing the plan.\par \par \uc2 "The main goal of our actions is to ensure banking liquidity. This mechanism allows us not to decrease the amount of liquidity."\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said that the volume of its daily \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be adjusted to compensate for the increased purchases of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the finance ministry, as would the amount of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  required to provoke a shift in the rouble's floating corridor.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spends $400 million a day to support the rouble when it is within 95 kopecks of the edge of a floating corridor against a dollar-euro basket, presently set at 34.70-41.70 rouble per basket.\par \par \uc2 When an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  allotment of $350 million is spent, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  automatically shifts the corridor by five kopecks.\par \par \uc2 These amounts would be adjusted by $100 million per day as long as the finance ministry purchases are taking place, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said.\par \par \uc2 "The indicated corrections in volumes of the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't have a significant influence on the dynamics of the national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  statement said.\par \par \uc2 The rouble fell in after-hours trade after the finance ministry and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  statements. At 1325 GMT it was trading at a record low of 41.45 against the dollar-euro basket , down 0.9 percent on the day.\par \par \uc2 ($1 = 35.2150 Russian roubles)   (Reporting by Lidia Kelly; Writing by Jason Bush Editing by Jeremy Gaunt)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2014-2-21T15:56:05.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020140218ea2i00bt1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
