\par\par \b \uc2 Russian Minister Says Economy Has Past Lowest Point -- Report\b0\par\par\uc2 212 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Januar 2014\par 09:10\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW--Russia's economy minister said Friday that the country's economic situation appears to have bottomed out in the third quarter of last year and is showing signs of improvement, according to Interfax news agency.\par \par \uc2 "Encouraging signs have emerged that the situation is gradually improving--this applies to areas of heavy industry which showed positive trends in the fourth quarter," Alexei Ulyukayev is quoted as saying by Interfax.\par \par \uc2 He also said agriculture grew more than 6% last year and that had made a "significant contribution" to the overall economic picture.\par \par \uc2 Russia's gross domestic product rose just 1.4% in 2013 amid stubbornly high inflation and receding oil prices. The Russian ruble has also seen its steadiest decline since the 2008 global financial crisis, but the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has largely opted not to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  as it tries to transition to a free-floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and inflation-targeting approach.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Ulyukayev has argued that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should discuss the possibility of postponing the change in policy and taking a broader approach instead.\par \par \uc2 Newspaper Web site: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.interfax.ru"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.interfax.ru}}}\par \par \uc2 -By Moscow Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; 7095-974-8055\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 January 31, 2014 03:10 ET (08:10 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020140131ea1v0010u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
