\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Russian  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  sticks to plans for free float - Nabiullina\b0\par\par\uc2 337 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Januar 2014\par 16:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2014 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds quotes)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Jan 30 (Reuters) - \uc2 Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will stick to its plans to get the rouble floating freely by next year, Governor \uc2 Elvira Nabiullina\uc2  said on Thursday, but did not rule out occasional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A heavy selloff of emerging markets \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , driven by a flight to the dollar as the U.S. Federal Reserve scales back its monetary stimulus, has put the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's complex \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  mechanism to the test this month.\par \par \uc2 Nabiullina said \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will pursue its strategic shift towards a policy of inflation targeting, but this would not rule out the possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 "We intend to observe these deadlines, as declared previously, of increasing the (flexibility) of the exchange rate this year," she told reporters.\par \par \uc2 "In our monetary and credit policy we do not intend to forsake \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  completely. We do intend to continue them to support financial stability," she told reporters, adding: "We will of course scale back \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  - this is a declared policy goal and we will stick to it."\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  now runs a "dirty" float of the rouble, conducting limited \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  as its exchange rate nears the edge of a flexible corridor. It made clear earlier that rouble \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be unlimited if it strays outside the band.\par \par \uc2 In its statements, the regulator has sought to clarify, but not change, a mechanism that foresees a shift of 5 kopecks in the rouble's trading band against a dollar-euro basket when an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  allotment of $350 million is exhausted.\par \par \uc2 Maximum daily \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  inside the seven-rouble corridor are $400 million. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced on Thursday that it had shifted the corridor by 25 kopecks the day before, implying that its dollar sales reached at least $1.75 billion. (Reporting by Darya Korsunskaya; Writing by Douglas Busvine, editing by Jason Bush/Ruth Pitchford)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2014-2-2T15:16:23.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020140130ea1u00bnk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
