\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Russian  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  halts 'targeted'  \highlight22\uc2 FX interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 403 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 2014\par 14:59\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2014 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds context, analyst, refinancing auction)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Jan 13 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Monday it was ceasing 'targeted' \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as part of a strategic shift towards letting the rouble float completely freely.\par \par \uc2 The reduction to zero of targeted \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which had been set at $60 million per day, will increase the flexibility of the exchange rate corridor used by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and reduce its presence on the market.\par \par \uc2 This will allow the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to serve as an external shock absorber for Russia's weakening economy, while reinforcing the role of interest rate policy.\par \par \uc2 "This adjustment was carried out with the goal of increasing the flexibility of determining the exchange rate, as part of making the gradual shift to a free float of the rouble by 2015," it said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  traditionally conducts targeted \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to offset the impact of expected imbalances on the current account that are largely the result of changes in the price of oil, the country's main export.\par \par \uc2 In addition, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  targets the rouble's exchange rate against a euro-dollar basket, raising \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  approaches the edge of an exchange-rate corridor and shifting the range once a $350 million allotment is exhausted.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week again adjusted the corridor, allowing the rouble to weaken by 5 kopecks and setting its new range at 33.15 to 40.15 roubles to the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket.\par \par \uc2 The rouble eased slightly after Monday's announcement, trading at 38.67 to the basket compared to 38.55 previously.\par \par \uc2 Dmitry Polevoy, ING's chief economist in Russia, said in a note that the move confirmed his forecast of rouble weakening.\par \par \uc2 Under Governor \uc2 Elvira Nabiullina\uc2 , appointed last June, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has surprised the market with its hawkish stance, holding its policy rate at 5.5 percent as inflation has strayed above target.\par \par \uc2 The regulator has, however, sought to keep the banking system liquid: in a separate announcement, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it had auctioned 480 billion roubles ($14.5 billion) in three-month funds at a cut-off rate of 5.76 percent. ($1 = 33.0382 Russian roubles) (Reporting by Oksana Kobzeva and Vladimir Abramov; Writing by Douglas Busvine; Editing by Ruth Pitchford)\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-CBANK/ (UPDATE 1) | ABN | D | E | RBN | M | RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020140113ea1d000pd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
