\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-New symbol fails to lift rouble\b0\par\par\uc2 555 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Dezember 2013\par 09:30\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates prices, adds comments, edits)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Dec 11 (Reuters) - The Russian rouble, which has officially acquired a new symbol to gain recognition on global markets, edged down on Wednesday, pressured by sluggish economic growth and year-end corporate selling.\par \par \uc2 The rouble was down 0.2 percent against the dollar at 32.77 , and 0.1 percent lower to 45.11 against the euro, leaving it 0.2 percent weaker at 38.32 against the dollar-euro basket.\par \par \uc2 "A weak macro environment is likely to keep rouble trading softly," Vladimir Osakovsky, an economist at BofAML said in a note, adding it was likely to remain dependent on year-end seasonal flows, such as debt payouts, and on the oil price.\par \par \uc2 Osakovsky sees the rouble at 33 per dollar by the end of this year and into next.\par \par \uc2 Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  approved the public's choice of a Cyrillic "P" with horizontal strokes as its official symbol, backing Kremlin efforts to enhance the international appeal of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The symbol was picked out of five proposed logos in a poll on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  website. In Russia's Cyrillic alphabet, the first letter of the word rouble resembles the Latin "P", a possible source of confusion for many foreigners.\par \par \uc2 "I don't see anything terrible (in the Cyrillic letter), investors will get used to it, as they did to balalaika or matryoshka," said \uc2 Denis Davydov\uc2 , an analyst at Nordea bank, referring to the instrument and the dolls.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is allowing the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to float more freely as Russia opens up its markets to foreign investors.\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut the amount of cumulative \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  it would make to maintain the rouble's floating exchange rate corridor to $350 million from $400 million.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sold around $23 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the year to date, so the rouble is trading 1.0-1.5 stronger against the dollar than it otherwise would be, Natalia Orlova, economist at Alfa bank said.\par \par \uc2 Reuters calculations suggest the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sold around $24.5 billion to stem the rouble's slide this year.\par \par \uc2 Moscow stock indexes inched up, trimming earlier losses with uncertainty over whether the Federal Reserve will start scaling back its bond buying next week capping further gains.\par \par \uc2 At 1248 GMT the rouble-denominated MICEX index was up 0.3 percent at 1,468 points and dollar-denominated RTS index rose 0.1 percent to 1,411 points.\par \par \uc2 The Russian stock market is traditionally strong in the fourth quarter and some investors are still hoping for a rally ahead of the New Year.\par \par \uc2 The RTS index has performed positively in December since 1995 with an average 5.9 percent monthly return but is down 1.4 percent over the current quarter and up 0.6 percent so far this month.\par \par \uc2 "The retreat in November has created a 6 percent fundamental upside," Slava Smolyaninov, a strategist at Uralsib Capital said in a note.\par \par \uc2 He added he favoured private rather than state-owned companies and exchange rate-sensitive stocks to take advantage of rouble strength in the short term. (Reporting by Maya Nikolaeva; Editing by Alison Williams)\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-MARKETS/ (UPDATE 1) | ABN | E | RBN | M | D | RNP | DNP | PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020131211e9cb000bv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
