\par\par \b \uc2 Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  Halves Daily  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\uc2  Target\b0\par\par\uc2 By Alexander Kolyandr   \par \uc2 211 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Oktober 2013\par 16:49\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW--\b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday took a step towards a fully free-floating ruble by cutting its daily \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  target to $60 million from $120 million.\par \par \uc2 "The adjustment is to ensure further increase of the ruble exchange rate flexibility in the context of the ongoing transition towards the floating exchange rate by 2015," the bank said in its statement, adding that it would reduce the presence of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and would increase the effectiveness of the interest rate policy.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps the ruble within a floating range against the basket and moves it by five kopecks either way if the amount of its accumulated purchases or sales of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  exceeds $400 million. The daily target is a technical parameter, which is aimed at capping an average daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In the upper range of the band the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sells dollars and euros to ease downside pressure on the ruble and starts buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the ruble firms toward the lower boundary of the band.\par \par \uc2 Write to Alexander Kolyandr at alexander.kolyandr@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 October 21, 2013 10:49 ET (14:49 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020131021e9al00342\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
