\par\par \b \uc2 Russia's cbank tweaks  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  policy mechanism\b0\par\par\uc2 237 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 2013\par 17:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Oct 8 (Reuters) - The \uc2 Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has changed the way it operates within the floating rouble corridor, widening a central band where it does not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market, as it gradually moves towards a free float.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Tuesday it had symmetrically widened a central, 'neutral', trading band where it does not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to 3.1 roubles from one rouble. The outer limits of the corridor, which has a seven-rouble span, remain unchanged.\par \par \uc2 "The increase of the potential flexibility of the exchange rate resulting from the implemented changes should contribute to strengthening the effectiveness of the interest rate policy ... for ensuring the price stability," it said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  increases market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the rouble nears the edge of the corridor for the rouble against a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket made up of 55 U.S. cents and 45 euro cents.\par \par \uc2 The floating rouble corridor, currently at 32.30 to 39.30 roubles, is shifted by 5 kopecks as soon as cumulative \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  reach $400 million, meaning that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not attempt to defend a particular exchange-rate level.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold a net total of $17.2 billion in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the first nine months of 2013.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Douglas Busvine, writing by Maya Dyakina)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 RUSSIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CBANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2  (URGENT) | ABN | D | E | RBN | M   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020131011e9a8000sr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
