\par\par \b \uc2 Russia cuts  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  sales to $3.5 bln in September\b0\par\par\uc2 325 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Oktober 2013\par 09:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2013 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Oct 2 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reduced its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by almost half last month, selling around $3.46 billion worth of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  compared to $6.1 billion in August, data showed on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $3.18 billion in dollars and 200 million euros.\par \par \uc2 The rouble firmed by 1.5 percent versus a euro-dollar basket during September, as investors scaled back bets on a near-term cut in official Russian interest rates, and took account of the postponed tapering of U.S. monetary stimulus.\par \par \uc2 The stronger rouble reduces the automatic \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  that occur when the rouble is near the boundaries of a trading corridor against the basket. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  shifted the corridor to 32.30-39.30 roubles to the basket , as of Sept. 30.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday the rouble eased 0.2 percent against the basket to 37.42.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sold a net total of $17.2 billion in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the start of the year. The bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves have fallen 4.2 percent since the end of 2012 as a result, but remain among the world's highest at $515.9 billion.\par \par \uc2 The bank said in a statement on Tuesday that it would adjust its daily \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in future according to the volume of the finance ministry's \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  to manage sovereign wealth funds.\par \par \uc2 The Finance Ministry plans to buy \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  worth 10 to 30 billion roubles to top up its Reserve Fund and the National Welfare Fund this year, which are together worth 5.4 trillion roubles ($170 billion) and held at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Previously, the funds were managed in off-market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . (Reporting by Maya Dyakina and Vladimir Abramov, editing by Jason Bush and Patrick Graham )\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 RUSSIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CBANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2  | RBN | C | D | E | M | O | U | MTL | GRO | SOF | OIL   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020131005e9a200029\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
