\par\par \b \uc2 Russia's lifts  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  sales to $6.1 bln in August to support rouble\b0\par\par\uc2 285 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 September 2013\par 11:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Sept 3 (Reuters) - \uc2 Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales to $6.1 billion in August to stem the rouble's slide, in its largest monthly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since September 2011, data showed on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The expected tapering of U.S. monetary stimulus as soon as this month and the crisis in Syria - both weighing particularly heavily on emerging markets - as well as a possible interest rate cut in Russia has dragged on the rouble in recent weeks.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $5.5 billion and 480 million euros on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, having shifted the exchange-rate corridor for the rouble to 32.15-39.15 roubles to the basket, as of Aug. 29.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sold $13.7 billion since the start of the year. The \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  have not significantly hit the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gold reserves, which have fallen by 5.8 percent since the start of the year to $508.1 billion.\par \par \uc2 However, Russia's vulnerability to external shocks has risen over the last five years with the total reserves in terms of months of imports they could cover falling to 10 months in 2008 to 2012, \uc2 World Bank\uc2  data shows.\par \par \uc2 Russia's commodities exports ensure it has a current account surplus. That surplus stood at $32 billion in January to June.\par \par \uc2 The rouble eased 0.1 percent on Tuesday against the dollar-euro \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, trading near four-year lows at 38.14. (Reporting by Maya Dyakina and Vladimir Abramov; Editing by Louise Ireland)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 RUSSIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CBANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2  | RBN | ABN | C | MTL | D | E | M | O | U | GRO | SOF | OIL   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020130906e993000ea\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
