\par\par \b \uc2 Russia  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Raises  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Corridor 5 Kopecks To RUB32.10-39.10\b0\par\par\uc2 By James Marson   \par \uc2 205 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 August 2013\par 08:13\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW--The Bank of Russia said Wednesday it has moved the ruble's trading band by five kopecks to reduce the amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  taking place amid an ongoing slide in \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on its website that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  band was moved five kopecks higher to RUB32.10-RUB39.10 ($0.97-$1.18) against the euro-dollar basket on Aug. 27.\par \par \uc2 This marks the fifth time this month that the bank has moved the range upward by five kopecks.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps the ruble within a floating range against the basket and moves it by five kopecks either way if the amount of its purchases or selling of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  exceeds $450 million in a day.\par \par \uc2 In the upper range of the band, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sells dollars and euros to ease downside pressure on the ruble and starts buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the ruble firms towards the lower boundary of the band. In the middle of the corridor, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  carries out no \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Write to James Marson at james.marson@dowjones.com [ 28-08-13 0624GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130828e98s0005g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
