\par\par \b \uc2 Russian  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2 's July  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  sales highest in nearly 2 years\b0\par\par\uc2 226 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 August 2013\par 14:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Aug 1 (Reuters) - The \uc2 Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $4.2 billion and 377 million euros from its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves in July, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed on Thursday, the biggest amount since October 2011.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been stepping up \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  over recent months as the rouble comes under sustained selling pressure.\par \par \uc2 In June, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had sold $2.7 billion and 246 million euros, while in May it sold just $237 million and 19 million euros.\par \par \uc2 Under the rouble's floating corridor regime, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  automatically \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth volatility whenever the rouble approaches the top or bottom of its corridor.\par \par \uc2 Emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  such as the rouble have been weakening in recent weeks, as expectations that U.S. monetary stimulus will be wound down lift the dollar. The rouble has been skirting the bottom of the corridor, forcing \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 On Thursday, the \uc2 Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also announced that it had shifted the corridor downwards, another automatic response to sustained selling pressure.\par \par \uc2 The new corridor extends from 31.85-38.85 roubles to the basket, compared with 31.75-38.75 last announced by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on July 8. (Reporting by Jason Bush; Editing by Ruth Pitchford)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 RUSSIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2 / | ABN | D | E | RBN | M   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020130804e9810004q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
