\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  cbank says no plans to tweak  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\uc2  because of Fin Min\b0\par\par\uc2 205 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juni 2013\par 18:30\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 ST PETERSBURG, \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , June 20 (Reuters) - \uc2 Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has no plans to change its mechanism of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market once the Finance Ministry starts converting its windfall energy revenues on the open market, deputy chairman \uc2 Sergei Shvetsov\uc2  said on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 "We will just address their demand (for cash) in our \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Nothing else is planned," Shvetsov told journalists on the sidelines of St Petersburg International Economic Forum.\par \par \uc2 The Finance Ministry is laying the ground for a shift in how it handles oil export revenues - a key part of its revenue base. From August, these dollar revenues will be transferred directly to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , obviating the need for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to conduct market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  to mob up rouble liquidity.\par \par \uc2 "If their desire to buy will be too high, it will be limited," Shvetsov said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  increases market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the rouble nears the boundary of its corridor against a dollar-euro \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, which extends from 31.65 to 38.65 roubles. (Reporting by Oksana Kobzeva, writing by Maya Dyakina; Editing by Lidia Kelly)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 RUSSIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CBANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2  (URGENT) | ABN | D | E | RBN | M   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020130623e96k0007f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
